  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_01",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "王红是北京机场的工作人员。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_02",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "她每天在机场工作。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_03",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "每天有很多外国人从法国、美国来北京。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_04",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他们常常问她:”请问，洗手间在哪儿?”"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_05",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "王红会说汉语，也会说法语。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_06",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "她很高兴。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_07",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "她说:”欢迎来中国!”"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_08a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "她每天在机场工作。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_08b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "她每天在法国工作。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_09a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "她会说汉语，也会说法语。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_09b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "她会说汉语，不会说法语。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-wanghong_09c",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "她会说法语，也会说美国。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_01",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克今天从法国来北京。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_02",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他坐飞机来，飞机很大。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_03",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他在北京机场下飞机。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_04",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "机场里有很多人，有中国人，也有外国人。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_05",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克想给朋友打电话，可是他的手机不在这儿。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_06",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "手机在行李里。马克在行李里找手机。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_07",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "\"手机在这儿!\"他很高兴。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_08",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他给朋友王明打电话:”王明,你在哪儿?”"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_09",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "王明说:”我在机场外面等你。\""
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_10",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克说:”我在洗手间前面。\""
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_11",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "王明说:”好,你在那儿等我。\""
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_12",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克在洗手间前面等朋友。他很高兴。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_13a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "手机在行李里。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_13b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "手机在洗手间里。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_13c",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "手机在飞机里。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_14a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "他在机场外面等马克。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-telephone_14b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "他在洗手间前面等马克。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_01",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克想坐飞机去上海。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_02",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他的朋友李华在上海。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_03",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他在机场里找工作人员。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_04",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "他给工作人员机票和护照。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_05",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "工作人员说:”谢谢，这是你的登机牌。\""
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_06",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克说:”请问，登机口在哪儿?”"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_07",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "工作人员说:”在前面。\""
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_08",
    "speaker": "narrateur",
    "text": "马克在登机口前面等飞机。他很高兴。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_09a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "马克想坐飞机去上海。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_09b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "马克想坐出租车去上海。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_09c",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "马克想坐飞机来北京。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_10a",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "他给工作人员机票和护照。"
  },
  {
    "vo": "lecture-depart_10b",
    "speaker": "player",
    "text": "他给工作人员手机和行李。"
  }
